__[Q1]{.Q}__: Predict what evaluating each of the following quosures will return if evaluated.

```{r}
q1 <- new_quosure(expr(x), env(x = 1))
q1

q2 <- new_quosure(expr(x + !!q1), env(x = 10))
q2

q3 <- new_quosure(expr(x + !!q2), env(x = 100))
q3
